title: Supervisor_D1_MorningInspection
---
监督员: 你就是新来的审查员？ #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_001 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_001 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 现在他们招人的标准都这么低了吗？ #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_002 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_002 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 哈哈哈哈哈，你这是什么表情？ #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_003 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_003 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 别介意嘛，开个小玩笑。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_004 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_004 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 你应该很清楚每天的工作流程吧？ #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_005 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_005 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 你的电脑上有三个选项“释放”“治疗”和“净化”。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_006 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_006 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 如果你觉得这人有意思，想留到第二天继续说话，可以选“治疗”，这样我们兄弟几个在“治疗”的时候也能找点乐子。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_007 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_007 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 实在没法教育的，就直接选择“净化”吧，让他们去建设我们的伟大祖国。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_008 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_008 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 对了，还有个释放按钮。只有你的教育取得被仪器认可的结果之后，释放按钮才会亮起。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_009 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_009 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 要我说，还是别释放他们吧，好不容易抓进来你又给放了，这不是打上头的脸吗？ #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_010 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_010 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 记得你每天最起码要净化一个人，不然你的指标没达成，你可就危险了呀。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_011 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_011 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 好了，检测时间到。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_012 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_012 #portrait:JD_04
监督员: 我们可是很注重公务员的心理健康的。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_013 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_013 #portrait:JD_04
监督员: 这玩意真方便，以前抓人还需要证据，现在让他扫一下就行了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_014 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_014 #portrait:JD_04
===

title: Supervisor_D1_Briefing
---
监督员: 不错嘛，你通过了检测。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_015 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_015 #portrait:JD_05
监督员: 好好干，我还会再来的。 #line:supervisor_P02_D1_R1_COMMON_016 #source:supervisor__P02_D1_R1_COMMON_016 #portrait:JD_05
===

title: Supervisor_D2_MorningInspection
---
监督员: 又见面了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_001 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_001 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 据我所知，你的活干的还不错嘛。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_002 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_002 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 让我听那些蛀虫说话，我可没那么多耐心。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_003 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_003 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 喂，我说。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_004 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_004 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 他们说的话，你不会真听了吧？ #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_005 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_005 #portrait:JD_02
监督员: 之前有个审查员听信了里面那些人的话，最后被仪器检测不通过。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_006 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_006 #portrait:JD_02
监督员: 他自然也成为了里面的一员。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_007 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_007 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 如果你不想重蹈覆辙，那我劝你少搭理他们。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_008 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_008 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 闲聊就到这吧。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_009 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_009 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 让我看看你是不是听了里头那些蛀虫的话。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_010 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_010 #portrait:JD_04
===

title: Supervisor_D2_Briefing
---
监督员: 不错嘛。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_011 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_011 #portrait:JD_05
监督员: 你最好继续保持。 #line:supervisor_P02_D2_R1_COMMON_012 #source:supervisor__P02_D2_R1_COMMON_012 #portrait:JD_05
===

title: Supervisor_D3_MorningInspection
---
监督员: 我又来了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_001 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_001 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 你还真是厉害啊。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_002 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_002 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 我们都在关注你，搞不好你很快就能升职了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_003 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_003 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 开玩笑的。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_004 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_004 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 你还真信了？ #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_005 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_005 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 路要一步一步走，孩子。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_006 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_006 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 升职可没那么容易，更没那么快。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_007 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_007 #portrait:JD_03
监督员: 顺带一提，你刚才的表情也被我记录下来了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_008 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_008 #portrait:JD_01
监督员: 好了，严肃点，检测时间到。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_009 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_009 #portrait:JD_04
===

title: Supervisor_D3_Briefing
---
监督员: 哦哦，你又一次通过了啊。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_010 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_010 #portrait:JD_05
监督员: 明天也许就没那么好运了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D3_R1_COMMON_011 #source:supervisor__P02_D3_R1_COMMON_011 #portrait:JD_05
===

title: Supervisor_D4_Ending
---
监督员: 惊——喜。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 做过什么你自己清楚。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 看来你要跟我走一趟了。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 进去之后，记得好好表现。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 也许就不会那么早迎来净化。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 我们之间也能多玩一会，不是吗？ #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006 #portrait:JD_06
监督员: 走吧。 #line:supervisor_P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007 #source:supervisor__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007 #portrait:JD_06
===
